#: ../developer/installation.md:1
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../developer/installation.md:3
msgid ""
"How to get a HybridInference gateway running, either as the Docker stack "
"or as a source checkout you can edit."
msgstr "本页介绍怎样把 HybridInference 网关跑起来：用 Docker 服务栈，或者直接从源码运行、方便自己修改。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:6
msgid ""
"If you would rather see a gateway answer a request before configuring "
"anything, start with the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md). It runs a "
"deterministic fake provider and needs no provider account, no API key and"
" no `.env` at all. This page is the next step: your own deployment, with "
"your own providers."
msgstr ""
"如果想先什么都不配、看网关实际应答一次请求，那就先看[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)。它用一个固定回复的假 "
"provider，不需要 provider 账号，不需要 API key，连 `.env` 都不用。本页是下一步：用你自己的 "
"provider，搭你自己的部署。"

