#: ../developer/installation.md:61
msgid ""
"These ports are reachable from the host by default. A reverse proxy on "
"the same host can use the loopback address; access from another machine "
"requires an explicit host override. See [Deployment Guide](deployment.md)"
" before exposing the console, which also forwards API requests."
msgstr ""
"这些端口默认可从宿主机访问。同机运行的反向代理可以使用回环地址；从其他机器访问则需要显式覆盖监听地址。控制台也会转发 API "
"请求，公开它之前请先阅读[部署指南](deployment.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:66
msgid "pgAdmin is in the Compose file too, behind the optional `admin` profile."
msgstr "Compose 文件中也包含 pgAdmin，通过可选的 `admin` profile 启动。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:68
msgid "First-run setup"
msgstr "首次运行设置"

#: ../developer/installation.md:70
msgid ""
"On its first start against an empty database the backend generates the "
"two secrets it cannot run without — `JWT_SECRET_KEY`, which signs sign-in"
" tokens, and `API_KEY_SECRET`, which protects API keys — and stores them "
"in the database. It then waits for an administrator: it creates a one-"
"time setup code, keeps it in the database, and prints it in its log:"
msgstr ""
"第一次连着空数据库启动时，后端会生成它运行所必需的两个密钥——签发登录 token 的 `JWT_SECRET_KEY`，以及保护 API key"
" 的 `API_KEY_SECRET`——并把它们存进数据库。然后它等待创建管理员：生成一个一次性的设置码，保存在数据库里，并打印在日志里："

#: ../developer/installation.md:80
msgid ""
"Open the console at `http://localhost:3001`, which sends you to its setup"
" page, and:"
msgstr "打开控制台 `http://localhost:3001`，它会把你带到设置页面，然后："

#: ../developer/installation.md:83
msgid ""
"Enter the setup code. It stays the same until setup is done, and the "
"backend logs it again every time it starts, whatever `LOG_LEVEL` is set "
"to. Until setup is done the backend also refuses sign-ups, so nobody else"
" can claim the first account."
msgstr ""
"输入设置码。在设置完成之前它保持不变，不管 `LOG_LEVEL` "
"设成什么，后端每次启动都会再把它记进日志。设置完成之前，后端也拒绝一切注册，所以别人抢不走第一个账号。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:87
msgid ""
"Create the administrator: a username and a password. The account has no "
"email address; it signs in with the username. Pick a username that is "
"hard to guess, not `admin`: sign-in allows five attempts per username in "
"15 minutes, counted before the password is checked, so anyone who knows "
"the username can lock the account out."
msgstr ""
"创建管理员：一个用户名和一个密码。这个账号没有邮箱地址，用用户名登录。选一个难猜的用户名，不要用 `admin`：登录对每个用户名每 15 "
"分钟只允许尝试五次，而且在检查密码之前就计数，所以知道用户名的人就能把这个账号锁住。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:92
msgid ""
"Fill in the settings the page lists. Out of the box the gateway serves "
"the three example models in `config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`, "
"which all use [OpenRouter](https://openrouter.ai) (one tries a local "
"Ollama server first), so `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` is listed as missing: set "
"it and they work. To serve your own models instead, see [Adding a New "
"Model](adding-models.md)."
msgstr ""
"填写页面列出的设置项。默认情况下，网关提供 `config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` "
"里的三个示例模型，它们都走 [OpenRouter](https://openrouter.ai)（其中一个会先尝试本地的 Ollama "
"服务器），所以 `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` 会被列为缺失：设置好它，这些模型就能用。要换成你自己的模型，见[添加新模型"
"](adding-models.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:97
msgid ""
"Finish. The model registry reads provider credentials when the backend "
"starts, so the last step offers **Restart backend** when anything you "
"saved needs it."
msgstr "完成。模型注册表在后端启动时读取 provider 凭据，所以只要你保存的内容需要重启，最后一步就会提供 **Restart backend**。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:101
msgid ""
"Everything set here can be changed later on the admin console's "
"**Configuration** tab; [Settings stored in the database](configuration.md"
"#settings-stored-in-the-database) explains how. [The first admin "
"account](deployment.md#the-first-admin-account) covers the other ways to "
"create an administrator and how to reset its password."
msgstr ""
"这里设置的所有内容，之后都可以在管理控制台的 **Configuration** "
"标签页上修改，做法见[存储在数据库中的设置项](configuration.md#settings-stored-in-the-"
"database)。创建管理员的其他方式，以及怎样重置它的密码，见[第一个管理员账号](deployment.md#the-first-"
"admin-account)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:108
msgid ""
"Keep the database with its secrets. `API_KEY_SECRET` cannot be changed "
"once it is set, because a new value would make every existing API key "
"stop working, and changing `JWT_SECRET_KEY` signs every user out. "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`, which protects the records of deleted accounts, "
"takes `API_KEY_SECRET`'s value unless you set it in `.env` before the "
"first start, and it cannot change afterwards either; see "
"[Database](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts). A database dump "
"carries these secrets and every provider key."
msgstr ""
"密钥和数据库要放在一起保管。`API_KEY_SECRET` 一旦设置就不能再改，因为新值会让现有的所有 API key 失效；改 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` 则会让所有用户退出登录。保护已删除账号记录的 "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`，除非你在第一次启动前就在 `.env` 里设置它，否则会沿用 `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"的值，而且之后同样不能再改；见[数据库](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts)。数据库的 dump"
" 里带着这些密钥和每一个 provider key。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:117
msgid ""
"A gateway without a database (`DB_ENABLED=false`) has no setup step and "
"no stored settings: it reads every setting from the environment, and with"
" user authentication on it needs `JWT_SECRET_KEY` and `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"there. Only a gateway with no database and no accounts runs without them "
"— `DB_ENABLED=false` **and** `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`, as in Stage 1 of "
"the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md)."
msgstr ""
"没有数据库的网关（`DB_ENABLED=false`）没有设置步骤，也没有存储的设置项：它从环境变量读取所有设置项；打开用户认证时，`JWT_SECRET_KEY`"
" 和 `API_KEY_SECRET` 也要放在环境变量里。只有既没有数据库、也没有账号的网关才能不要它们——即 "
"`DB_ENABLED=false` **并且** `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`，就像[快速开始](router-"
"tutorial.md)的阶段 1 那样。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:124
msgid "Development checkout (no Docker)"
msgstr "本地开发（不用 Docker）"

