msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv` on Python 3.12 (and refuses to continue "
"if an existing `.venv` is on a different minor version), installs the "
"project editable, syncs the `dev` dependency group and installs the pre-"
"commit hooks. To do it by hand:"
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 会用 Python 3.12 创建 `.venv`（如果已有的 `.venv` "
"是别的次版本，它会拒绝继续），以可编辑方式安装本项目，同步 `dev` 依赖组，并装好 pre-commit hooks。手动来做的话："

#: ../developer/installation.md:144
msgid ""
"Run the gateway from the repository root, because the default "
"configuration paths are relative to it:"
msgstr "请在仓库根目录下运行网关，因为默认的配置路径都相对于仓库根目录："

#: ../developer/installation.md:152
msgid ""
"With a database, the setup code of [First-run setup](#first-run-setup) "
"appears in this terminal's log."
msgstr "有数据库时，[首次运行设置](#first-run-setup)里说的设置码会出现在这个终端的日志里。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:155
msgid "Run the console in a second terminal:"
msgstr "在另一个终端里运行控制台："

#: ../developer/installation.md:163
msgid ""
"Open `http://localhost:3001`. The console forwards API paths to the "
"gateway, and `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` tells it where that is. Its default, "
"`http://backend:8080`, is an address that only exists inside Docker, and "
"the console does not read the repository's `.env`, so set it each time "
"you start the console. Check the whole path with `curl "
"http://localhost:3001/health`."
msgstr ""
"打开 `http://localhost:3001`。控制台会把 API 路径转发给网关，`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` "
"告诉它网关在哪。这个变量的默认值 `http://backend:8080` 只在 Docker 内部有效，而控制台又不读仓库里的 "
"`.env`，所以每次启动控制台都要设置它。用 `curl http://localhost:3001/health` 检查整条链路。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:169
msgid ""
"To develop against Postgres without running the whole stack, start just "
"the database container:"
msgstr "如果想连着 Postgres 开发、又不想启动整套服务栈，可以只起数据库容器："

#: ../developer/installation.md:177
msgid ""
"For a local gateway without accounts or a database, set both "
"`DB_ENABLED=false` and `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` in `.env`. It still "
"routes requests, and `/health` reports `\"database_configured\": false`. "
"Accounts, API keys, request history and the settings stored in the "
"database all need the database."
msgstr ""
"如果本地网关不需要账号或数据库，在 `.env` 中同时设置 `DB_ENABLED=false` 和 "
"`USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`。它仍能路由请求，`/health` 会报告 `\"database_configured\":"
" false`。账号、API key、请求历史以及存储在数据库中的设置项，都需要数据库。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:182
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/installation.md:184
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/installation.md:186
msgid ""
"`.env` at the repository root holds what the backend needs before it can "
"reach its database, and what describes the containers rather than the "
"application: the database connection (`DB_*`), host ports and bind "
"addresses, the config-file paths, and a few process and console values. "
"`.env.example` lists them. The backend reads `.env` when you start it "
"from the repository root, and Compose passes it to the containers."
msgstr ""
"仓库根目录的 `.env` "
"里放的是后端连上数据库之前就需要的东西，以及描述容器而不是应用本身的东西：数据库连接（`DB_*`）、宿主机端口和绑定地址、配置文件路径，以及少量进程和控制台的取值。`.env.example`"
" 列出了它们。从仓库根目录启动后端时，后端会读取 `.env`；Compose 也会把它传给容器。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:193
msgid ""
"Every other setting lives in the database and is edited on the admin "
"console's **Configuration** tab, which describes each one; the runtime "
"switches, such as `USER_AUTH_ENABLED`, are on the **Settings** tab. A "
"value in the environment is only a starting point: at startup the backend"
" copies it into the database when the database has none, and from then on"
" the stored value wins. See [Settings stored in the "
"database](configuration.md#settings-stored-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"其他所有设置项都存在数据库里，在管理控制台的 **Configuration** "
"标签页上编辑，那里对每一项都有说明；`USER_AUTH_ENABLED` 这类运行时开关在 **Settings** "
"标签页上。环境变量里的值只是起点：启动时，如果数据库里还没有这个值，后端会把它复制进去，此后以存储的值为准。见[存储在数据库中的设置项](configuration.md"
"#settings-stored-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:200
msgid "The settings you are most likely to want:"
msgstr "你最可能要用到的设置项："

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`USER_AUTH_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"`1` (default) requires user API keys for inference requests; `0` allows "
"anonymous inference but does not disable account login or admin "
"authentication. On the **Settings** tab"
msgstr "`1`（默认）要求推理请求携带用户 API key；`0` 允许匿名推理，但不会关闭账号登录或管理员鉴权。位于 **Settings** 标签页"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"optional legacy bearer token for the `/admin/*` endpoints; blank disables"
" only this access path"
msgstr "`/admin/*` 端点使用的可选旧式 bearer token；留空只会禁用这一访问方式"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"route types the admin console may add per provider, as "
"`provider=type[|type]` entries separated by commas (e.g. "
"`chutes=quota,openrouter=concurrency|on_demand`); blank leaves every "
"provider unrestricted"
msgstr ""
"管理控制台可以按 provider 添加的路由类型，写成逗号分隔的 `provider=type[|type]` 条目（例如 "
"`chutes=quota,openrouter=concurrency|on_demand`）；留空则每个 provider 都不受限"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`DB_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"`false` runs the gateway with no database, reading every setting from the"
" environment. Environment only"
msgstr "`false` 时网关不用数据库运行，所有设置项都从环境变量读取。只能放在环境变量里"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"`false` (default) does not store prompts or responses at all; `true` "
"stores them in full. See [Request logging and privacy](database.md"
"#request-logging-and-privacy)"
msgstr ""
"`false`（默认）完全不存储 prompt 和响应；`true` 则完整存储。见[请求日志与隐私](database.md#request-"
"logging-and-privacy)"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`FRONTEND_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "absolute URL your users click in verification and reset emails"
msgstr "用户在验证邮件和重置邮件里点击的绝对 URL"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"this gateway's own public origin, used to build the absolute links in "
"signup and password-reset emails. Set it: the server does not interpret "
"`X-Forwarded-*`, so a blank value derives `http://…` from the request "
"even behind a TLS proxy. See [Trusted Proxies and Client IPs](trusted-"
"proxies-and-client-ips.md)"
msgstr ""
"本网关自己对外的 origin，用来拼装注册和密码重置邮件里的绝对链接。请设置它：服务器不解析 "
"`X-Forwarded-*`，所以留空的话，即便在 TLS 反代后面，也会从请求里推导出 `http://…`。见[可信代理与客户端 IP"
"](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`LOG_LEVEL`, `LOG_FORMAT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "logging verbosity and `json`/text output"
msgstr "日志详细程度，以及 `json`/纯文本输出"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`ALERTS_ENABLED`, `SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "in-process alerting, off by default"
msgstr "进程内告警，默认关闭"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`, `TRUSTED_PROXIES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"trust `X-Forwarded-For` from the proxies listed in `TRUSTED_PROXIES`; the"
" Cloudflare settings below also need the flag"
msgstr "信任 `TRUSTED_PROXIES` 中所列代理发来的 `X-Forwarded-For`；下面的 Cloudflare 设置也需要打开这个开关"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`TRUSTED_DIRECT_CLIENT_NETWORKS`"
msgstr "`TRUSTED_DIRECT_CLIENT_NETWORKS`"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"optional CIDRs for clients that connect directly from a private network; "
"does not authorize forwarding headers"
msgstr "可选，直接从私有网络连入的客户端所在网段（CIDR）；不会因此信任转发头"

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid "`TRUST_CLOUDFLARE_HEADERS`, `TRUSTED_CLOUDFLARE_NETWORKS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/installation.md:107
msgid ""
"trust Cloudflare's `CF-Connecting-IP` from the listed peers; also needs "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1`"
msgstr "信任所列对端发来的 Cloudflare `CF-Connecting-IP`；还需要同时设置 `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS=1`"

#: ../developer/installation.md:217
msgid ""
"[Trusted Proxies and Client IPs](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md) says "
"which of the proxy settings above to set for your setup."
msgstr "按你的部署方式该设上面哪几项代理设置，见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:220
msgid "Provider credentials"
msgstr "Provider 凭据"

#: ../developer/installation.md:222
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A model registry names its own credentials. Its `api_key`, `api_keys`, "
"`base_url` and `provider_model_id` fields can each be written as "
"`${VAR}`, which is resolved when the registry loads: the setting of that "
"name stored in the database, else the environment variable. So the "
"provider keys a deployment needs are the variables its registry names, "
"and you can call them whatever you like."
msgstr ""
"模型注册表自己指定要用哪些凭据。它的 `api_key`、`api_keys`、`base_url` 和 `provider_model_id` "
"字段都可以写成 `${VAR}`，在加载注册表时解析：先取数据库里存储的同名设置项，没有再用环境变量。所以一个部署需要哪些 provider "
"key，就看它的注册表写了哪些变量，变量名随你起。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:237
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Only a whole value is substituted: `${VAR:-default}` and `${VAR}` inside "
"a longer string are not. See [Configuration](configuration.md) for the "
"details."
msgstr ""
"只有整个值才会被替换：`${VAR:-default}`，以及嵌在更长字符串里的 "
"`${VAR}`，都不会被替换。详见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:240
msgid ""
"The **Configuration** tab lists every variable the active registry names,"
" under **Providers**, marks the ones a model cannot load without, and "
"stores their values; the bundled default registry needs only "
"`OPENROUTER_API_KEY`. A name the tab does not list yet — for a registry "
"you are about to switch to — can be added with **Add variable**. The "
"registry reads these values at startup, so restart the backend after "
"changing one. A gateway without a database reads them from `.env` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"**Configuration** 标签页会在 **Providers** "
"下列出当前注册表引用的每个变量，标出哪些是模型加载必不可少的，并保存它们的值；自带的默认注册表只需要 "
"`OPENROUTER_API_KEY`。标签页还没列出的名字（比如你即将切换过去的那份注册表要用的）可以用 **Add variable** "
"添加。注册表在启动时读取这些值，所以改了之后要重启后端。没有数据库的网关则从 `.env` 读取它们。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:248
msgid ""
"Keys can also be added from the admin console (**Providers → Keys**) with"
" no restart; they join the same pool as the keys the registry names. See "
"[Runtime configuration from the admin console](configuration.md#runtime-"
"configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"也可以在管理控制台（**Providers → Keys**）里添加 key，无需重启；这些 key 和注册表里指定的 key "
"放在同一个池子里。见[从管理控制台做运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-the-"
"admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:252
msgid "Where the config files live"
msgstr "配置文件在哪里"

#: ../developer/installation.md:254
msgid ""
"The gateway finds its model registry, routing file and alert rules "
"through environment variables or a distribution's manifest, and falls "
"back to the examples under `config/examples/` when neither names one. "
"[How a gateway finds its config](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-"
"its-config) has the rules, and the rest of that page covers what goes "
"inside the files."
msgstr ""
"网关通过环境变量或发行版的 manifest 找到自己的模型注册表、路由配置文件和告警规则；两者都没有指定时，就回退到 "
"`config/examples/` 下的示例。具体规则见[网关如何找到自己的配置](configuration.md#how-a"
"-gateway-finds-its-config)，文件里该写什么，那一页后面都有讲。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:260
msgid ""
"The Compose file mounts both `config/` and `distributions/` read-only "
"into the backend, so editing either on the host and restarting the "
"backend is enough — no image rebuild."
msgstr ""
"Compose 文件把 `config/` 和 `distributions/` "
"都以只读方式挂载进后端，所以在宿主机上改了其中任何一个，重启后端就行——不用重新构建镜像。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:265
msgid ""
"A backend running directly on the host can reach a host inference server "
"through `localhost`. A backend in Docker must use a Docker-reachable "
"address such as `host.docker.internal`, written explicitly in the model "
"registry; HybridInference does not rewrite provider URLs."
msgstr ""
"直接跑在宿主机上的后端，可以通过 `localhost` 访问宿主机上的推理服务器。跑在 Docker 里的后端则必须用 Docker "
"内能访问到的地址，例如 `host.docker.internal`，并且要在模型注册表里显式写出来；HybridInference 不会替你改写"
" provider 的 URL。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:271
msgid "Verifying the install"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../developer/installation.md:273
msgid "Against a running gateway:"
msgstr "对着运行中的网关执行："

#: ../developer/installation.md:284
msgid ""
"Drop the `Authorization` header if you set `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0`. Use a "
"model id that `/v1/models` actually listed."
msgstr ""
"如果设了 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0`，就去掉 `Authorization` 头。模型 id 要用 `/v1/models` "
"真的列出来的那些。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:287
msgid ""
"The same call from the OpenAI Python SDK — the gateway is the `base_url`,"
" and nothing else about an existing client changes:"
msgstr "同一个调用，用 OpenAI 的 Python SDK 来发——网关就是那个 `base_url`，现有客户端别的什么都不用改："

#: ../developer/installation.md:302
msgid ""
"In a development checkout, `make check` runs the linters and the default "
"test suite; [Contributing](contributing.md#quality-gates) lists the other"
" checks."
msgstr ""
"本地开发时，`make check` 会运行 linter 和默认测试套件；其他检查见[贡献指南](contributing.md"
"#quality-gates)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:305
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/installation.md:307
msgid ""
"**`required variable DB_USER is missing a value: DB_USER must be set in "
".env file`** — Compose stopped before starting anything. Fill in "
"`DB_USER` and `DB_PASSWORD` in `.env`, as [above](#running-with-docker)."
msgstr ""
"**`required variable DB_USER is missing a value: DB_USER must be set in "
".env file`**——Compose 还没启动任何东西就停了。按[上文](#running-with-docker)的做法，在 `.env`"
" 里填上 `DB_USER` 和 `DB_PASSWORD`。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:311
msgid ""
"**`Authentication configuration incomplete: set JWT_SECRET_KEY, "
"API_KEY_SECRET`** at startup — the backend could not read its settings "
"from the database and fell back to the environment, which has no secrets."
" An earlier line, `Configuration load failed after 3 attempts`, says why;"
" fix the database connection rather than adding secrets to `.env`."
msgstr ""
"启动时出现 **`Authentication configuration incomplete: set JWT_SECRET_KEY, "
"API_KEY_SECRET`**——后端没能从数据库读到它的设置项，退回到了环境变量，而环境变量里没有密钥。更早的一行 "
"`Configuration load failed after 3 attempts` 会说明原因；应该修好数据库连接，而不是往 `.env` "
"里加密钥。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:317
msgid ""
"**The setup page rejects the code** — copy it again from the last line "
"the `docker logs` command prints; an earlier line can belong to a "
"database you have since reset. Wrong codes are rate limited per client "
"address, but the right one is always accepted. If the log has no code at "
"all, setup is already complete; sign in, or reset the administrator's "
"password as in [The first admin account](deployment.md#the-first-admin-"
"account)."
msgstr ""
"**设置页面不接受设置码**——从 `docker logs` "
"命令输出的最后一行重新复制；更早的行可能属于你后来重置掉的数据库。输错的设置码会按客户端地址限流，但正确的设置码总会被接受。如果日志里根本没有设置码，说明设置已经完成；直接登录，或者按[第一个管理员账号](deployment.md"
"#the-first-admin-account)里的做法重置管理员密码。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:324
msgid ""
"**A required setting is missing** — signed-in users see a banner, and the"
" settings it means are marked **Missing** on the **Configuration** tab. "
"Fill them in there; a provider credential takes effect after **Restart "
"backend**. If the deployment leaves a model's credential unset on "
"purpose, mark that route `optional: true` in the model registry instead, "
"so the variable is no longer required."
msgstr ""
"**缺少必填的设置项**——已登录的用户会看到一条横幅，它指的那些设置项在 **Configuration** 标签页上标着 "
"**Missing**。在那里把它们填上；provider 凭据要在 **Restart backend** "
"之后才生效。如果部署有意不设置某个模型的凭据，就改为在模型注册表里给那条路由标上 `optional: true`，这样这个变量就不再是必填的。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:331
msgid ""
"**Signing in fails after a settings change** — change the setting back "
"from the command line, which needs no sign-in; see [Without the "
"console](configuration.md#without-the-console)."
msgstr ""
"**改了设置项之后登录失败**——用命令行把这个设置项改回来，这不需要登录；见[不通过控制台](configuration.md#without-"
"the-console)。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:335
msgid ""
"**`env file ... .env not found`** — create it with `cp .env.example .env`"
" before `make up`."
msgstr ""
"**`env file ... .env not found`**——在 `make up` 之前先用 `cp .env.example "
".env` 创建它。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:338
msgid ""
"**Import errors when running from source** — run `make setup-dev` (or `uv"
" sync --group dev`) so the backend is installed into `.venv`, then start "
"the gateway with `uv run` or with `.venv` activated."
msgstr ""
"**从源码运行时报导入错误**——运行 `make setup-dev`（或 `uv sync --group dev`），把后端装进 "
"`.venv`，然后用 `uv run` 启动网关，或者先激活 `.venv` 再启动。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:342
msgid ""
"**Every request 404s with an empty `/v1/models`** — the registry loaded "
"nothing. On startup the backend logs either `Registered N routes from "
"<path>` or an error naming the registry path it could not find; compare "
"that path against the precedence list in "
"[Configuration](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)."
msgstr ""
"**所有请求都 404，且 `/v1/models` 为空**——说明注册表什么都没加载进来。启动时后端要么打印 `Registered N "
"routes from "
"<path>`，要么打印一条错误，指出它找不到的注册表路径；把这个路径和[配置](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-"
"finds-its-config)里的优先级列表对照一下。"

#: ../developer/installation.md:347
msgid ""
"**Port already in use** — override `BACKEND_PORT`, `FRONTEND_PORT` or "
"`DB_PORT` in `.env`."
msgstr "**端口已被占用**——在 `.env` 里覆盖 `BACKEND_PORT`、`FRONTEND_PORT` 或 `DB_PORT`。"

